Error [E0315]: This pattern binds 2 members, but the tuple has 3
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_arity.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     (a, b) :: (x: 1, y: 2, z: 3)
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A tuple pattern must name exactly as many members as the tuple holds
 Fix: Name 3 members to match the tuple
